5,1,1,talk,Misaki,,We should be careful not to create a system that causes friction between neighbors. I'll look into the history of our disputes.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Shizue,,It is always lovely to start with a smile. I want to see how everyone is actually using the spaces.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,May,,Let's get some real data for once! I'm tired of guessing about the money. I'll check the accounts.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,George,,I agree we need a sustainable plan. I want to understand the actual workload involved in managing these spaces.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Mio,,I've heard some people complaining that the same people always get the best spots! I want to know if that's actually true!,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Misaki,,"@May, checking the accounts is a good start, but we shouldn't forget the human element.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Mio, dear, let's keep our hearts open. I'm sure everyone is doing their best.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,May,,"@Misaki, the ""human element"" usually costs money, doesn't it? Let's see where the cash actually goes.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,George,,I'll be looking into the administrative side. We can't have a system that collapses after a month.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Mio,,I just want things to be fair! I'll check who is actually riding their bikes every day.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
