35,2,1,talk,Misaki,,"It seems we've avoided reviewing the allocation for years, which is likely why some people are unhappy.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Shizue,,"I noticed that the mornings are quite a squeeze. It's a bit of a scramble to get out, isn't it?","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,May,,"Well, the ledger is a mess. We're barely tracking anything, and the current cash collection is a joke.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,George,,The paperwork for the current system is already a burden. Adding more complexity will just lead to failure.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Mio,,I knew it! The same people have had the covered spots for years without any review! That's totally unfair!,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Mio, while it may seem unfair, we should avoid a sudden change that creates new animosity.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Mio, dear, let's remember that some of our neighbors might struggle more than others with their bikes.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,May,,"@George, if we're worried about the burden, maybe we should just charge a fee to simplify the selection process.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,George,,A fee doesn't remove the administrative work of collecting it and tracking who paid. We need simplicity.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Mio,,But we can't just leave it as it is! The people who actually use their bikes every day are the ones who should have the spots!,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Misaki,,"If we prioritize only ""daily riders,"" we might alienate those who use their bikes occasionally but need them for essentials.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Shizue,,I worry that the bikes are getting bumped and scratched in the rush. We should find a way to be gentler.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,May,,"@Misaki, let's be real. If we don't put a price on it, people will just fight over the ""best"" spots forever.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,George,,"I'm concerned that any ""fair"" system we design will be too tedious to maintain. We need a low-effort solution.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Mio,,"@May, I actually found out that some daily riders are willing to pay! Maybe that's the answer?","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Misaki,,Let's consider the options carefully. I don't want us to stop greeting each other in the lobby because of a bike spot.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Shizue,,A little kindness goes a long way. I hope we can choose a way that makes everyone feel cared for.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,May,,I'm just looking for a solution that doesn't involve me doing more unpaid accounting for this building.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,George,,I will support the option that requires the least amount of ongoing manual oversight.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Mio,,"I'm voting for whatever actually changes the status quo! No more ""same people, same spots"" forever!","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
